---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title={"Asesmen Hidup Sehat Gratis | Ingat Sehat"}
  description={"Asesmen gaya hidup sehat gratis ±4 menit: pola makan, aktivitas, tidur, stres, dan tujuan kesehatan Anda. Dapatkan insight, area yang sudah baik, dan saran produk pelengkap sesuai jawaban Anda."}
  ogDescription={"Jawab pertanyaan seputar pola makan, aktivitas, tidur, dan stres. Dapatkan insight dan saran sesuai jawaban Anda. Gratis, ±4 menit."}
  path={"/asesmen.html"}
  activeNav={"asesmen"}
  extraScripts={["/js/asesmen.js"]}
>
  <section class="page-intro as-intro">
          <div class="wrap">
            <div>
              <h1>Asesmen Hidup Sehat</h1>
              <p>Jawab pertanyaan seputar pola makan, aktivitas, tidur, stres, dan tujuan kesehatan Anda. Anda akan mendapat insight gaya hidup, area yang sudah baik, dan saran produk pelengkap yang sesuai dengan jawaban Anda. Gratis, tanpa daftar.</p>
              <ul class="hero-proof">
                <li><i class="fas fa-stopwatch" aria-hidden="true"></i> ±4 menit</li>
                <li><i class="fas fa-user-shield" aria-hidden="true"></i> Jawaban diproses di perangkat Anda, tidak disimpan</li>
              </ul>
              <p class="cek-link">Mau yang lebih singkat? <a href="cek.html">Cek 7 Pilar (1 menit)</a></p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
  
        <section class="section section--tight" id="asesmen">
          <div class="wrap">
            <form class="as-form" id="as-form" novalidate>
              <div class="as-card" id="bag-1">
              <h2 class="as-bag"><span>1</span> Tentang Anda</h2>
              <div class="as-grid2">
              <fieldset class="as-q as-q--inline" data-q="gender">
                <legend><i class="fas fa-venus-mars as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Jenis kelamin</span></legend>
                <div class="as-opts as-opts--row">
                  <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="gender" value="p" /><span>Pria</span></label>
                  <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="gender" value="w" /><span>Wanita</span></label>
                </div>
              </fieldset>
              <div class="as-num" data-q="usia">
                <label for="as-usia"><i class="fas fa-birthday-cake as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i> Usia</label>
                <div class="as-unit"><input id="as-usia" name="usia" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="12" max="100" /><span>tahun</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="as-num" data-q="tinggi">
                <label for="as-tinggi"><i class="fas fa-ruler-vertical as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i> Tinggi badan</label>
                <div class="as-unit"><input id="as-tinggi" name="tinggi" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="100" max="230" /><span>cm</span></div>
              </div>
              <div class="as-num" data-q="berat">
                <label for="as-berat"><i class="fas fa-weight as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i> Berat badan</label>
                <div class="as-unit"><input id="as-berat" name="berat" type="number" inputmode="decimal" min="25" max="250" step="0.1" /><span>kg</span></div>
              </div>
              </div>
              <fieldset class="as-q as-q--inline" data-q="rokok">
                <legend><i class="fas fa-smoking as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Apakah Anda merokok (termasuk rokok elektrik)?</span></legend>
                <div class="as-opts as-opts--row">
                  <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="rokok" value="1" /><span>Ya</span></label>
                  <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="rokok" value="0" /><span>Tidak</span></label>
                </div>
              </fieldset>
              </div>
  
              <div class="as-card" id="bag-2">
              <h2 class="as-bag"><span>2</span> Makan &amp; minum</h2>
              <fieldset class="as-q" data-q="air">
                <legend><i class="fas fa-glass-whiskey as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Berapa banyak air putih yang Anda minum setiap hari?</span></legend><p class="as-hint">1 gelas ±240 mL.</p>
                <div class="as-opts">
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="air" value="0" /><span>1 gelas atau kurang</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="air" value="1" /><span>2–4 gelas</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="air" value="2" /><span>5–7 gelas</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="air" value="3" /><span>8 gelas atau lebih</span></label>
              </div>
              </fieldset>
              <h3 class="as-sub">Berapa porsi kelompok makanan ini yang Anda makan <strong>setiap hari</strong>?</h3>
              <div class="as-sels">
              <div class="as-sel" data-q="buah">
                <i class="fas fa-apple-alt as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <label for="as-buah">Buah <small>1 porsi = 1 buah sedang atau ½ mangkuk potongan</small></label>
                <select id="as-buah" name="buah"><option value="" selected>Pilih</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6+</option></select>
              </div>
              <div class="as-sel" data-q="sayur">
                <i class="fas fa-carrot as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <label for="as-sayur">Sayur <small>1 porsi = 1 mangkuk sayur matang</small></label>
                <select id="as-sayur" name="sayur"><option value="" selected>Pilih</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6+</option></select>
              </div>
              <div class="as-sel" data-q="susu">
                <i class="fas fa-cheese as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <label for="as-susu">Susu &amp; olahannya <small>1 porsi = 1 gelas susu, 1 cup yoghurt, atau 1 lembar keju</small></label>
                <select id="as-susu" name="susu"><option value="" selected>Pilih</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6+</option></select>
              </div>
              <div class="as-sel" data-q="biji">
                <i class="fas fa-seedling as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <label for="as-biji">Biji-bijian utuh <small>nasi merah, oat, roti gandum utuh; 1 porsi = ½ piring nasi atau 1 lembar roti</small></label>
                <select id="as-biji" name="biji"><option value="" selected>Pilih</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6+</option></select>
              </div>
              <div class="as-sel" data-q="gula">
                <i class="fas fa-candy-cane as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <label for="as-gula">Makanan &amp; minuman manis <small>1 porsi = 1 kue, 1 donat, 1 minuman manis kemasan, atau 1 gelas es teh manis</small></label>
                <select id="as-gula" name="gula"><option value="" selected>Pilih</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6+</option></select>
              </div>
              </div>
              <h3 class="as-sub">Berapa kali <strong>seminggu</strong> Anda makan:</h3>
              <div class="as-sels">
              <div class="as-sel" data-q="daging">
                <i class="fas fa-drumstick-bite as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <label for="as-daging">Daging merah <small>sapi, kambing</small></label>
                <select id="as-daging" name="daging"><option value="" selected>Pilih</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7+</option></select>
              </div>
              <div class="as-sel" data-q="ikan">
                <i class="fas fa-fish as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
                <label for="as-ikan">Ikan</label>
                <select id="as-ikan" name="ikan"><option value="" selected>Pilih</option><option value="0">0</option><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="3">3</option><option value="4">4</option><option value="5">5</option><option value="6">6</option><option value="7">7+</option></select>
              </div>
              </div>
              <fieldset class="as-q" data-q="menu">
                <legend><i class="fas fa-hamburger as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Seberapa sering Anda makan menu yang persis sama?</span></legend><p class="as-hint">Contoh: nasi goreng, mi instan, ayam goreng dengan lauk yang sama.</p>
                <div class="as-opts">
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="menu" value="0" /><span>2 kali atau lebih per minggu</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="menu" value="1" /><span>Sekali seminggu</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="menu" value="2" /><span>2–3 kali per bulan</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="menu" value="3" /><span>Sebulan sekali atau lebih jarang</span></label>
              </div>
              </fieldset>
              </div>
  
              <div class="as-card" id="bag-3">
              <h2 class="as-bag"><span>3</span> Kebiasaan harian</h2>
              <fieldset class="as-q" data-q="bab">
                <legend><i class="fas fa-toilet as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Seberapa sering Anda buang air besar?</span></legend>
                <div class="as-opts">
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="bab" value="0" /><span>3 hari sekali atau lebih jarang</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="bab" value="1" /><span>1–2 hari sekali</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="bab" value="2" /><span>Sekali sehari</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="bab" value="3" /><span>2–3 kali sehari</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="bab" value="4" /><span>Lebih dari 3 kali sehari</span></label>
              </div>
              </fieldset>
              <fieldset class="as-q" data-q="duduk">
                <legend><i class="fas fa-chair as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Berapa lama Anda duduk setiap hari (bekerja, di kendaraan, menonton)?</span></legend>
                <div class="as-opts">
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="duduk" value="0" /><span>1–2 jam</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="duduk" value="1" /><span>3–4 jam</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="duduk" value="2" /><span>5–7 jam</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="duduk" value="3" /><span>8 jam atau lebih</span></label>
              </div>
              </fieldset>
              <h3 class="as-sub">Berapa kali <strong>seminggu</strong> Anda melakukan aktivitas ini minimal 30 menit?</h3>
              <fieldset class="as-q" data-q="ringan">
                <legend><i class="fas fa-walking as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Aktivitas ringan <small>masih bisa bicara lancar, bahkan bernyanyi: jalan santai, menyapu, berkebun</small></span></legend>
                <div class="as-opts">
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="ringan" value="0" /><span>Tidak melakukan</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="ringan" value="1" /><span>1–2 kali</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="ringan" value="2" /><span>3–4 kali</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="ringan" value="3" /><span>5 kali atau lebih</span></label>
              </div>
              </fieldset>
              <fieldset class="as-q" data-q="sedang">
                <legend><i class="fas fa-running as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Aktivitas sedang <small>napas lebih cepat, masih bisa bicara, sedikit berkeringat: jalan cepat, bersepeda santai, berenang santai</small></span></legend>
                <div class="as-opts">
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="sedang" value="0" /><span>Tidak melakukan</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="sedang" value="1" /><span>1–2 kali</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="sedang" value="2" /><span>3–4 kali</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="sedang" value="3" /><span>5 kali atau lebih</span></label>
              </div>
              </fieldset>
              <fieldset class="as-q" data-q="beratakt">
                <legend><i class="fas fa-dumbbell as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Aktivitas berat <small>napas terengah, sulit bicara, banyak berkeringat: lari, futsal, angkat beban, senam aerobik</small></span></legend>
                <div class="as-opts">
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="beratakt" value="0" /><span>Tidak melakukan</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="beratakt" value="1" /><span>1–2 kali</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="beratakt" value="2" /><span>3–4 kali</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="beratakt" value="3" /><span>5 kali atau lebih</span></label>
              </div>
              </fieldset>
              </div>
  
              <div class="as-card" id="bag-4">
              <h2 class="as-bag"><span>4</span> Stres, tidur &amp; energi</h2>
              <fieldset class="as-q" data-q="stres">
                <legend><i class="fas fa-bolt as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Bagaimana tingkat stres Anda belakangan ini?</span></legend>
                <div class="as-opts">
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="stres" value="0" /><span>Tidak stres</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="stres" value="1" /><span>Antara tidak stres dan sedang</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="stres" value="2" /><span>Stres sedang</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="stres" value="3" /><span>Antara sedang dan berat</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="stres" value="4" /><span>Stres berat</span></label>
              </div>
              </fieldset>
              <fieldset class="as-q" data-q="tidur">
                <legend><i class="fas fa-bed as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Berapa malam dalam seminggu Anda tidur 5 jam atau kurang?</span></legend>
                <div class="as-opts">
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="tidur" value="0" /><span>Tidak pernah</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="tidur" value="1" /><span>1–2 malam</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="tidur" value="2" /><span>3–4 malam</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="tidur" value="3" /><span>5–6 malam</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="tidur" value="4" /><span>Setiap malam</span></label>
              </div>
              </fieldset>
              <fieldset class="as-q" data-q="energi">
                <legend><i class="fas fa-battery-half as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Bagaimana tingkat energi Anda sehari-hari?</span></legend>
                <div class="as-opts">
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="energi" value="0" /><span>Sangat lemas</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="energi" value="1" /><span>Antara lemas dan cukup</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="energi" value="2" /><span>Cukup bertenaga</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="energi" value="3" /><span>Antara cukup dan sangat bertenaga</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="energi" value="4" /><span>Sangat bertenaga</span></label>
              </div>
              </fieldset>
              <fieldset class="as-q" data-q="imun">
                <legend><i class="fas fa-shield-alt as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Menurut Anda, seberapa kuat daya tahan tubuh Anda?</span></legend>
                <div class="as-opts">
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="imun" value="0" /><span>Lemah (mudah sakit)</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="imun" value="1" /><span>Antara lemah dan sedang</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="imun" value="2" /><span>Sedang</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="imun" value="3" /><span>Antara sedang dan kuat</span></label>
              <label class="as-opt"><input type="radio" name="imun" value="4" /><span>Kuat (jarang sakit)</span></label>
              </div>
              </fieldset>
              </div>
  
              <div class="as-card" id="bag-5">
              <h2 class="as-bag"><span>5</span> Tujuan Anda</h2>
              <fieldset class="as-q" data-q="area">
                <legend><i class="fas fa-bullseye as-ikon" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Area kesehatan mana yang paling ingin Anda jaga? <small>(pilih maksimal 3)</small></span></legend>
                <p class="as-hint as-hitung" aria-live="polite">0 dari 3 dipilih</p>
                <div class="as-checks">
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="otot" /><span>Otot, tulang &amp; sendi</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="pria" /><span>Kesehatan pria</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="cerna" /><span>Pencernaan</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="ginjal" /><span>Ginjal &amp; saluran kemih</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="wanita" /><span>Kesehatan wanita</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="aktif" /><span>Gaya hidup aktif</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="metabolisme" /><span>Metabolisme</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="mata" /><span>Kesehatan mata</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="detoks" /><span>Membersihkan tubuh (detoks)</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="imun" /><span>Daya tahan tubuh</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="mulut" /><span>Kesehatan gigi &amp; mulut</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="kulit" /><span>Kulit &amp; kecantikan</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="gula" /><span>Kadar gula darah</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="berat" /><span>Mengelola berat badan</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="antioksidan" /><span>Antioksidan</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="energi" /><span>Energi</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="otak" /><span>Otak &amp; saraf (fokus, daya ingat)</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="jantung" /><span>Jantung &amp; peredaran darah</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="penuaan" /><span>Penuaan sehat</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="vitalitas" /><span>Vitalitas &amp; stamina</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="napas" /><span>Pernapasan</span></label>
              <label class="as-check"><input type="checkbox" name="area" value="stres" /><span>Suasana hati, stres &amp; tidur</span></label>
                </div>
              </fieldset>
              <div class="as-setuju" data-q="setuju">
                <label class="as-check as-check--setuju"><input type="checkbox" name="setuju" value="1" /><span>Saya mengerti bahwa asesmen ini alat bantu edukasi gaya hidup, <strong>bukan diagnosis medis</strong>, dan rekomendasi produk bersifat pelengkap, bukan pengganti saran dokter.</span></label>
              </div>
              <p class="as-galat" role="alert" hidden></p>
              <button type="submit" class="btn btn--blue as-lanjut"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check" aria-hidden="true"></i> Lihat hasil saya</button>
              </div>
              <noscript><p class="small">Aktifkan JavaScript untuk melihat hasil asesmen, atau <a href="https://wa.me/6287718227922?text=Halo%2C%20saya%20mau%20konsultasi%20gaya%20hidup%20sehat">tanya kami lewat WhatsApp</a>.</p></noscript>
            </form>
  
            <div class="as-hasil" id="hasil" hidden tabindex="-1">
              <div class="as-card as-hasil-head">
                <p class="eyebrow-cek">Hasil asesmen</p>
                <h2>Terima kasih sudah menyelesaikan Asesmen Hidup Sehat.</h2>
                <p class="muted" id="as-ringkas"></p>
              </div>
  
              <div class="as-card" id="reko">
                <h2 class="as-judul"><i class="fas fa-capsules" aria-hidden="true"></i> Berdasarkan jawaban Anda, ini produk yang kami sarankan</h2>
                <p class="muted small">Suplemen adalah <strong>pelengkap</strong> gaya hidup sehat, bukan obat dan bukan pengganti makan bergizi, tidur cukup, dan olahraga. Harga terbaru ada di toko online resmi 4Life.</p>
                <div class="as-produk" id="as-produk"></div>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn--ghost as-lebih" data-lebih="produk" hidden><i class="fas fa-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"></i> Tampilkan rekomendasi lainnya</button>
                <p class="as-catatan small" id="as-catatan" hidden></p>
                <p class="small">Mau rutin atau untuk sekeluarga? Lihat <a href="tf.html#paket">paket hemat</a> dan <a href="tf.html#member">Member Loyalitas</a> (poin 15% dari setiap order).</p>
              </div>
  
              <div class="as-card as-bagus" id="bagus" hidden>
                <h2 class="as-judul"><i class="fas fa-trophy" aria-hidden="true"></i> Sudah bagus di area ini</h2>
                <ul class="as-bagus-list" id="as-bagus"></ul>
              </div>
  
              <div class="as-card" id="insight">
                <h2 class="as-judul"><i class="fas fa-lightbulb" aria-hidden="true"></i> Insight untuk Anda</h2>
                <ul class="as-insight" id="as-insight"></ul>
